    "turn_text": "Back home, the number one issue is this open southern border. As the police officers told me last week, we're not going to be able to arrest ourselves out of the problem. The pecan crime that we're seeing, the fentanyl poisoning, the human trafficking, they said, you could double the number of police officers. We cannot arrest ourselves out of this problem. So to me, this is the defining issue of this election, both for the control of the Senate, as well as who is going to be the president.",
