    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Right. So certainly we were very involved in our community and we were the person if you were running for governor or for Senate, we would do the fundraiser at our house. So that was our extent of our involvement in politics was doing fundraising. And at one point in time, some folks came to me and said, we would like for you to run for the House of Representatives. And my wife said, heck no. And as a matter of fact, she said, I want you to promise me you're not going to start doing the new businesses.",
