    "turn_text": "Getting involved in 2015 is interesting because you basically came on the scene in that new way right in the middle of everything about the Republican Party changing, or going back to its roots, I would argue. What's it been like to get engaged in politics during the Trump era, essentially? How is that framed? How you think about the issues? What kind of elected officials you've chosen to be? What you've chosen to prioritize? Right,",
