  {
    "episode_id": 96850,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96850.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "I always talk about priorities up here. Everyone brings me all these good ideas and most of the ideas we need to spend more money in their particular program. And then they want me to balance the budget, but not on their back as well. So it's about priorities. And let's just be really clear here. My leadership on the Senate side, their priority is to fund Ukraine. So they were going to use this border deal as no one's talking about this that use this border deal is a lever to get their Ukraine funding. Interesting Joe Biden just just recently when he was talking to the Japanese Prime Minister, the first thing he mentions is Ukraine, the ugly American saying, We know you got all these problems in Indochina, and I had just met with the Prime Minister from Japan a couple of days before one-on-one, and here's the ugly American. You got your own problems with China, but we want to make sure that you're supporting Ukraine. So anyway, they're using",
