    "turn_text": "So one of the snide snickering things that the media has started to say every time someone like yourself, uh, or, you know, someone in Montana or someone in Ohio brings up the border issue is, why do you care? You know, you're not, you're not a border state. You're not Texas. You're not New Mexico. I think it'd be valuable to get your perspective, what you're hearing from your state, in terms of what the consequences of this open border actually are for everyday Kansans, because I think what's changed over the last couple of decades is every state's in border state now.",
